  "body": "[MSC1915](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/1915) says that when a server receives an unbind request without an `id_server` param it should default to using the `id_server` which was used during the bind (if any). This requires that Synapse actually tracks that information, which currently it does not.",
